Package: com.rinapple.switzachwidgetprobe
Name: SwitzachWidgetProbe
Version: 3.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Home screen widgets for sideloaded apps on Switzach
 Puts the widgets of sideloaded apps on the Switzach home screen, the way iOS
 does: a widget gallery (+ button > Add Widget), small, medium and large sizes,
 resizing, stacks (Edit Stack), widget settings (Edit Widget), removal with the
 − badge or the long-press menu, live updates, interactive buttons, and links
 that open the app at the right place. Widgets follow the home screen's icon
 style: colored, dark, clear (Liquid Glass) and tinted.
 .
 Each app's widgets run in a process of their own, not in SpringBoard: a widget
 that crashes ends only that process, which is started again.
Maintainer: rinapple
Author: rinapple
Homepage: https://github.com/Aquaappl/switzachwidgetprobe
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
